WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.200
The biggest mistake people make in marketing is assuming that more traffic automatically means more sales.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:14.000
Actually, what matters is attracting people who already understand the problem and are ready to act.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
If you only optimize for clicks, you can easily miss the customers that will make your business grow.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Start by finding the questions your best customers ask right before they buy, and answer those questions directly.
